      "text": "```\nCOAGULATION CASCADE REVIEW:\n  Intrinsic path: XII → XI → IX → VIII (+ IXa) → X\n  Extrinsic path: VII + TF → X\n  Common path: X → V → prothrombin → thrombin → fibrinogen → fibrin"
    },
